 style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Abastecimentos l\u00edquidos ao longo do percurso entre Playa Am\u00e9rica (Nigr\u00e1n) e Baiona<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 18.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 22.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 31\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/02 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4:<\/strong> 28.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/03 a 24\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona Vigo-Bayona 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 26\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Meia Maratona Gran Bah\u00eda Vig-Bay e a 6\u00aa MiniBay realizam-se no domingo, 11 de abril de 2027. A Meia Maratona parte da Avenida de Samil, em Vigo, \u00e0s 10:00 (09:50 para a categoria de diversidade funcional), enquanto a MiniBay parte \u00e0s 09:30 de Playa Am\u00e9rica (Nigr\u00e1n), terminando ambas em Baiona (Pontevedra, Espanha).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis na Vig-Bay 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento compreende duas corridas de estrada em circuito linear costeiro: a Meia Maratona Vig-Bay com 21,097 km (ligando Vigo, Nigr\u00e1n e Baiona, aberta a maiores de 18 anos) e a MiniBay com 10,548 km \u2014 metade da meia maratona \u2014 entre Playa Am\u00e9rica (Nigr\u00e1n) e Baiona (aberta a partir dos 16 anos).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 3 de novembro de 2026 a 24 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 em vig-bay.com. Na Meia Maratona (21,1 km) os valores s\u00e3o de 24 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2026), 28 \u20ac (janeiro), 32 \u20ac (fevereiro) e 38 \u20ac (1 a 24 de mar\u00e7o). Na MiniBay (10,5 km) os pre\u00e7os fixam-se em 18 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2026), 22 \u20ac (janeiro), 25 \u20ac (fevereiro) e 28 \u20ac (mar\u00e7o).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 efetuado o levantamento de dorsais e que servi\u00e7os de transporte existem?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento de dorsais realiza-se no Museo VERBUM \u2013 Casa de las Palabras (Avenida de Samil 17, Vigo) na sexta-feira e s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 prova, bem como no domingo antes da partida. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza autocarros mediante reserva entre Baiona, Nigr\u00e1n e Vigo, al\u00e9m de servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro m\u00f3vel da partida at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova e existem marcadores de ritmo (pacers)?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite (cut-off) da Meia Maratona \u00e9 de 2 horas e 45 minutos ap\u00f3s o tiro de partida. A prova disp\u00f5e de partida por caixas de tempo, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos a cada 5 km e lebres oficiais (pacers) para os tempos l\u00edquidos de 1h30, 1h40, 1h45, 1h50, 1h55 e 2h00.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona Vigo-Bayona 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-11\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida de Samil, Vigo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vigo\", \"addressRegion\": \"Espanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"description\": \"A Meia Maratona Vigo-Bayona 2027 realiza-se a 11 de abril entre Vigo e Baiona, Espanha. Provas de 21,1 km e 10,5 km (MiniBay). Consulta percurso e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-vigo-bayona.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"XXVI Meia Maratona Gran Bah\u00eda Vig-Bay (21,097 km)\", \"price\": \"24.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/vig-bay.com\/inscripcion\/\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona Vig-Bay \u2013 Diversidade Funcional \/ Cadeiras de Rodas & Handbike\", \"price\": \"24.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/vig-bay.com\/inscripcion\/\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"VI MiniBay \u2013 De la Media, la Mitad (10,548 km)\", \"price\": \"18.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/vig-bay.com\/inscripcion\/\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Club de Corredores Vig-Bay\"}}<\/s